{"version":"https://jsonfeed.org/version/1.1","title":"所有文章","description":"这里不仅是我研习中医经典的私人书斋，更是一处致力于 “观照经典以明医理，颐养身心以扶正气” 的清净之地。","home_page_url":"https://acuherb.xyz/","language":"zh-CN","icon":"https://acuherb.xyz/apple-touch-icon.png","favicon":"https://acuherb.xyz/favicon.ico","authors":[{"name":"Acuherb","url":"https://acuherb.xyz/","avatar":"https://acuherb.xyz/images/avatar.webp"}],"items":[{"title":"学习导读","date_published":"2026-09-26T10:15:00&#43;08:00","date_modified":"2026-09-26T10:18:00&#43;08:00","id":"https://acuherb.xyz/posts/study-guide/","url":"https://acuherb.xyz/posts/study-guide/","authors":[{"name":"Acuherb","url":"https://acuherb.xyz/","avatar":"https://acuherb.xyz/images/avatar.webp"}],"summary":"欢迎来到观颐斋。这里整理了本博客所有中医经典的学习笔记，按推荐学习顺序排列。点击下方任意条目，即可进入对应的合集，查看该经典的全部文章。\n针灸大成神农本草经黄帝内经素问黄帝内经灵枢黄帝外经 伤寒论金匮要略石室秘录 医话 如果你刚接触中医，建议从《针灸大成》或《黄帝内经·素问》开始；如果你已有基础，可以直接跳到《伤寒论》和《金匮要略》。\n学习过程中如果遇到疑问，欢迎在下方留言讨论，也欢迎通过“关于”页面添加我的微信。\n","content_html":"\u003cp\u003e欢迎来到观颐斋。这里整理了本博客所有中医经典的学习笔记，按推荐学习顺序排列。点击下方任意条目，即可进入对应的合集，查看该经典的全部文章。\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cdiv class=\"fixit-docs-navigation\"\u003e\n  \u003cul class=\"fixit-docs-outline\"\u003e\u003cli\u003e\u003ca href=\"/collections/%e9%92%88%e7%81%b8%e5%a4%a7%e6%88%90/\" title=\"学习《针灸大成》，掌握经络腧穴与针刺技法，夯实针灸基础。\"\u003e针灸大成\u003c/a\u003e\u003c/li\u003e\u003cli\u003e\u003ca href=\"/collections/%e7%a5%9e%e5%86%9c%e6%9c%ac%e8%8d%89%e7%bb%8f/\" title=\"研读《神农本草经》，熟悉常用中药的性味归经、功效主治与配伍禁忌。\"\u003e神农本草经\u003c/a\u003e\u003c/li\u003e\u003cli\u003e\u003ca href=\"/collections/%e9%bb%84%e5%b8%9d%e5%86%85%e7%bb%8f%e7%b4%a0%e9%97%ae/\" title=\"研读《黄帝内经·素问》，建立中医整体观与辨证思维。\"\u003e黄帝内经素问\u003c/a\u003e\u003c/li\u003e\u003cli\u003e\u003ca href=\"/collections/%e9%bb%84%e5%b8%9d%e5%86%85%e7%bb%8f%e7%81%b5%e6%9e%a2/\" title=\"研读《黄帝内经·灵枢》，深入理解经络腧穴与针刺理论。\"\u003e黄帝内经灵枢\u003c/a\u003e\u003c/li\u003e\u003cli\u003e\u003ca href=\"/collections/%e9%bb%84%e5%b8%9d%e5%a4%96%e7%bb%8f/\" title=\"研读《黄帝外经》，拓展中医理论与临床思路。\"\u003e黄帝外经 \u003c/a\u003e\u003c/li\u003e\u003cli\u003e\u003ca href=\"/collections/%e4%bc%a4%e5%af%92%e8%ae%ba/\" title=\"精研《伤寒杂病论》，掌握六经辨证体系，将理论与临床紧密结合。\"\u003e伤寒论\u003c/a\u003e\u003c/li\u003e\u003cli\u003e\u003ca href=\"/collections/%e9%87%91%e5%8c%ae%e8%a6%81%e7%95%a5/\" title=\"研读《金匮要略》，掌握杂病辨证论治的精髓。\"\u003e金匮要略\u003c/a\u003e\u003c/li\u003e\u003cli\u003e\u003ca href=\"/collections/%e7%9f%b3%e5%ae%a4%e7%a7%98%e5%bd%95/\" title=\"研读《石室秘录》，深入理解中医辨证论治的精妙之处。\"\u003e石室秘录 \u003c/a\u003e\u003c/li\u003e\u003cli\u003e\u003ca href=\"/collections/%e5%8c%bb%e8%af%9d/\" title=\"记录临证心得与思考，分享中医学习与临床的体悟。\"\u003e医话\u003c/a\u003e\u003c/li\u003e\u003c/ul\u003e\n  \u003cdiv class=\"fixit-docs-preview\"\u003e\u003c/div\u003e\n\u003c/div\u003e\n\u003cp\u003e如果你刚接触中医，建议从《针灸大成》或《黄帝内经·素问》开始；如果你已有基础，可以直接跳到《伤寒论》和《金匮要略》。\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003e学习过程中如果遇到疑问，欢迎在下方留言讨论，也欢迎通过“关于”页面添加我的微信。\u003c/p\u003e"},{"title":"黄帝内经灵枢","date_published":"0001-01-01T00:00:00Z","date_modified":"2026-01-21T16:04:32&#43;08:00","id":"https://acuherb.xyz/posts/lingshu/","url":"https://acuherb.xyz/posts/lingshu/","authors":[{"name":"Acuherb","url":"https://acuherb.xyz/","avatar":"https://acuherb.xyz/images/avatar.webp"}],"content_html":"黄帝内经灵枢"},{"title":"黄帝内经素问","date_published":"0001-01-01T00:00:00Z","date_modified":"2026-01-21T16:04:32&#43;08:00","id":"https://acuherb.xyz/posts/suwen/","url":"https://acuherb.xyz/posts/suwen/","authors":[{"name":"Acuherb","url":"https://acuherb.xyz/","avatar":"https://acuherb.xyz/images/avatar.webp"}],"content_html":"黄帝内经素问"},{"title":"黄帝外经","date_published":"0001-01-01T00:00:00Z","date_modified":"2026-01-21T16:04:32&#43;08:00","id":"https://acuherb.xyz/posts/waijing/","url":"https://acuherb.xyz/posts/waijing/","authors":[{"name":"Acuherb","url":"https://acuherb.xyz/","avatar":"https://acuherb.xyz/images/avatar.webp"}],"content_html":"黄帝外经"},{"title":"金匮要略","date_published":"0001-01-01T00:00:00Z","date_modified":"2026-01-21T16:04:32&#43;08:00","id":"https://acuherb.xyz/posts/jingui/","url":"https://acuherb.xyz/posts/jingui/","authors":[{"name":"Acuherb","url":"https://acuherb.xyz/","avatar":"https://acuherb.xyz/images/avatar.webp"}],"content_html":"金匮要略"},{"title":"伤寒论","date_published":"0001-01-01T00:00:00Z","date_modified":"2026-01-21T16:04:32&#43;08:00","id":"https://acuherb.xyz/posts/shanghan/","url":"https://acuherb.xyz/posts/shanghan/","authors":[{"name":"Acuherb","url":"https://acuherb.xyz/","avatar":"https://acuherb.xyz/images/avatar.webp"}],"content_html":"伤寒论"},{"title":"神农本草经","date_published":"0001-01-01T00:00:00Z","date_modified":"2026-01-21T16:04:32&#43;08:00","id":"https://acuherb.xyz/posts/bencao/","url":"https://acuherb.xyz/posts/bencao/","authors":[{"name":"Acuherb","url":"https://acuherb.xyz/","avatar":"https://acuherb.xyz/images/avatar.webp"}],"content_html":"神农本草经"},{"title":"石室秘录","date_published":"0001-01-01T00:00:00Z","date_modified":"2026-04-20T14:45:54&#43;08:00","id":"https://acuherb.xyz/posts/shishimilu/","url":"https://acuherb.xyz/posts/shishimilu/","authors":[{"name":"Acuherb","url":"https://acuherb.xyz/","avatar":"https://acuherb.xyz/images/avatar.webp"}],"content_html":"石室秘录"},{"title":"医话","date_published":"0001-01-01T00:00:00Z","date_modified":"2026-03-08T11:36:11&#43;08:00","id":"https://acuherb.xyz/posts/yihua/","url":"https://acuherb.xyz/posts/yihua/","authors":[{"name":"Acuherb","url":"https://acuherb.xyz/","avatar":"https://acuherb.xyz/images/avatar.webp"}],"content_html":"医话"},{"title":"针灸大成","date_published":"0001-01-01T00:00:00Z","date_modified":"2026-01-21T16:04:32&#43;08:00","id":"https://acuherb.xyz/posts/zhenjiu/","url":"https://acuherb.xyz/posts/zhenjiu/","authors":[{"name":"Acuherb","url":"https://acuherb.xyz/","avatar":"https://acuherb.xyz/images/avatar.webp"}],"content_html":"针灸大成"}]}